  "recipe": {
    "technique": "The lace is made using thread-wound bobbins and a lace pattern (a pencil-drawn motif) that is fixed on a cylindrical lacemaking pillow which is placed in a shallow basket. The tape is made with bobbins at the same time as the rest of the lace, curving back on itself, and joined using a crochet hook. In addition, pins and scissors must be used."
